WEBVTT

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:20.640
What's wrong, Nene?

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:29.620
<i>There's something I want to look into, 
so I'm going to be late getting back.</i>

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:33.920
<b>There's something I want to look into,
so I'm going to be late getting back.
Please see off the caged birdies.</b>

00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:33.580
<i>Please see off the caged birdies.</i>

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:34.880
<b>Thanks!</b>

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:42.530
Stupid Ellen...

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:48.890
Kohagura Ellen, first-year high school 
student from Osafune Girls' School.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.390
You participated in the 
tournament matches, didn't you?

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:55.550
Oh, how embarrassing. That was 
a very disappointing result.

00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:57.920
I see you've decided to feign ignorance.

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:01.730
Um... may I put my hands down now?

00:01:01.730 --> 00:01:05.790
I don't have any intention 
of fighting with you.

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:08.530
Then hand over your okatana.

00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:10.120
And your cell phone.

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:15.590
My hands were going numb.

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:18.420
So, what were you doing here?

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:22.470
Well, you saw how my 
match turned out, right?

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:24.110
I knew that if I went back empty-handed,

00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:27.440
I would get a serious scolding 
from my school's president,

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:31.810
so I thought that I would get credit 
by catching Yukari-sama's attackers.

00:01:31.810 --> 00:01:36.310
Then the reason you brought out
S Equipment was to catch the traitors?

00:01:36.310 --> 00:01:39.320
S Equipment? What are you talking about?

00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:42.480
Last night, two S Equipment 
containers of unknown origin

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:45.390
were launched toward 
the middle of Mount Izu.

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:49.140
We believe they were prepared 
for the escaping traitors.

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:51.680
It's only natural that we would 
think they belonged to you

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:54.710
and the one other representative 
from Osafune, Mashiko Kaoru.

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:01.840
I'm hungry!

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:06.410
It seems we need to ask you a few things.

00:02:23.150 --> 00:02:33.450
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:50.870
<b>Episode 6  The Space Between Humans and Disgrace</b>

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:48.830
What do you mean, you don't 
want me to interrogate her?

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:51.530
I mean exactly that.

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:56.070
Do you intend to ignore that 
Yukari-sama placed me in charge?

00:03:56.070 --> 00:03:59.540
Goodness, using your position 
as a shield to get your way

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:01.820
isn't like you at all.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:08.070
You're not going to let that 
girl see your eye, are you?

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:10.880
She might be a part of Mokusa.

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:17.580
I seem to be lacking calm after 
falling behind in last night's fight.

00:04:18.220 --> 00:04:19.460
Where are you going?

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:20.850
To calm myself.

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:24.560
Perhaps I teased her too much?

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:28.610
I am also lacking calm myself.

00:04:28.940 --> 00:04:32.950
If you are indeed their friend,

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:37.410
I will have to make you pay, Kohagura-san.

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:42.070
Thank you for the food.

00:04:42.070 --> 00:04:43.540
Was it to your liking?

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:45.590
It's a bit annoying

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:48.950
that they microwave the pickles with the 
convenience store lunch boxes though.

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:53.050
Really? I don't really mind it so much.

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:55.730
You're an interesting person.

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:02.560
About that S Equipment...
 It's already been carried away.

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:05.710
That's really nothing to do with me.

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:09.040
Kohagura is certainly an unusual name.

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:12.530
But I felt like I had 
heard it somewhere before.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:16.610
And I remembered why a little bit ago.

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:19.780
It seems the chief engineer 
of the S Equipment

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:23.680
development team that transferred 
from DARPA had that name.

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:28.670
I believe her name was 
Jacqueline Anne Kohagura?

00:05:28.670 --> 00:05:30.710
Jacqueline is my mother.

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:33.620
And let me also just say that my father,

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:36.930
Kohagura Kimitake, works with her, but...

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:42.740
Even the head of development cannot 
launch an unregistered unit.

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:45.600
The development and creation 
of the S Equipment

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:48.690
is all being done under the 
control of the Origami family.

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:52.570
But I wonder about your grandfather?

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:54.540
My grandpa?

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.200
Grandpa is...

00:05:56.200 --> 00:06:00.100
Yes, Richard Friedman, the brilliant 
scientist who became the forerunner

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:05.210
of noro's military use and pioneered 
the development of the S Equipment.

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:09.790
Five years ago, after selling off the 
technological development company

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:12.110
he founded himself,
 he suddenly disappeared, right?

00:06:12.110 --> 00:06:12.970
Yes.

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:18.450
Are you aware that there is evidence 
that Dr. Friedman has entered Japan?

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:20.850
And he has been in contact with Mokusa.

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:25.440
No, rather, what if he was one of the 
people who formed the core of Mokusa?

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:27.860
Mogusa? Is that like moxibustion?

00:06:29.390 --> 00:06:31.860
You insist on playing dumb?

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:33.660
Well, it's no matter.

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:38.770
Oh, that's right.
About your friend, Mashiko Kaoru...

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:44.000
Are you aware that she faced off against 
our comrade Satsuki Yomi last night?

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:50.700
It seems this is the first you're hearing
 of it. Or are you still just playing dumb?

00:06:51.100 --> 00:06:53.510
Well, regardless of the reason,

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:56.430
turning your blade on a 
member of the elite guard

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:59.390
is the same as turning 
your blade on Yukari-sama.

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:02.770
That sin is remedied with death...

00:07:03.140 --> 00:07:07.240
Regardless of whether or not you 
and Mashiko-san are part of Mokusa.

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:10.270
What happened to Kaoru?

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:11.310
Who knows?

00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:13.490
I will speak with you again.

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:22.660
<b>Irozaki</b>

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:22.660
Only six more kilometers.

00:07:23.110 --> 00:07:26.610
I wonder if Ellen-chan and Kaoru-chan 
are safely on their way, too?

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:33.090
N-Nene-chan?

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:36.370
If he's here, then that means...

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:41.150
Kaoru-chan, you're all right!

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:43.020
I'll help you reach the meeting point.

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:45.690
Kaoru-chan?

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:48.670
What is it?

00:07:49.450 --> 00:07:50.590
What's wrong?

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:54.180
Apparently, he wants to take us somewhere.

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:55.120
Nene!

00:07:56.730 --> 00:07:58.900
What happened to the other girl?

00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:00.320
Where's Ellen-chan?

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:09.890
Come in.

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:22.300
Sorry, it's just me.

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:26.390
Where did Yukari-sama go?

00:08:26.390 --> 00:08:27.300
Who knows?

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:29.950
When I got here, she was already gone.

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:32.950
Even though I came all 
this way to play with her.

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:33.810
I see.

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:36.570
I know, why don't I go look for her?

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:38.000
No, thank you.

00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:42.570
So boring!

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:14.100
Just rest for now.

00:09:25.110 --> 00:09:28.130
Do you know the meaning of the word "limit"?

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:30.830
What do you want?

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:32.610
We're heading out.

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:34.290
Did we find the others?

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:35.990
It's unconfirmed,

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:40.480
but we've obtained a report that they 
were spotted in the mountains of Minamiizu.

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:44.290
I don't believe there are any 
other middle school girls running

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:46.300
around the mountains in their uniforms.

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:49.120
Let's go, Suzuka.

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:52.270
I'm the one who came to get you.

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:57.760
Squads One and and Two with me!

00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:00.720
Squad Three, wait here for 
further communication!

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:01.650
Roger!

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:18.710
Well, then, I guess it's 
time I got moving, too.

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:40.050
Hi! It's been a while, my sweet Yasutsugu!

00:10:57.030 --> 00:10:59.670
I must be useful, no matter what.

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:06.330
I see. So this is the reason 
Kaoru drew her okatana on her.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:27.220
What poor manners. If you knew I 
was here, you should have said so.

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:31.980
Such considerations are not necessary 
for those who wrong Yukari-sama.

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:36.580
Then I will show no restraint, either.

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:40.610
I'm pretty skilled with my fingers!

00:11:42.390 --> 00:11:43.840
Here I come.

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:04.050
There will be no end to them this way.

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:06.610
I'll have to destroy the source.

00:12:21.460 --> 00:12:24.880
Toji aren't necessarily just 
skilled in the use of swords.

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:28.260
Not enough.

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:30.130
More...

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:33.010
More power...

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:51.280
A-A horn?!

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:52.490
Are you a demon?

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:54.650
For my master.

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:02.420
I'm not holding back then!

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:09.200
My deadly stomach blow didn't work?!

00:13:11.550 --> 00:13:14.690
This is just a little bit bad.

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:17.680
Kohagura escaped?

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:20.970
Yes. Squad member Satsuki 
is currently pursuing her.

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:23.310
Isn't that for the best?

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:26.290
The fox is bringing out its tail.

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:31.190
No, I guess "tanuki" would 
be more fitting? Or else—

00:13:31.190 --> 00:13:34.950
Yes. This is Yomi we're talking about.
 She won't get away so easily.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:38.850
So you can no longer generate utsushi?

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:40.620
En garde.

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:46.960
Kaoru?!

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:52.300
You're still alive, Ellen.

00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:53.570
Yes!

00:13:53.570 --> 00:13:54.910
Then use kongoushin.

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:57.930
Home run!

00:13:57.930 --> 00:14:00.210
Y-You idiot!

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:05.460
A-Are you okay, Ellen-chan?

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:08.880
K-Kanamin? What are you doing here?

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:11.280
Hiyoyon is here, too! See?

00:14:12.010 --> 00:14:14.280
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:18.910
I only came to make sure which 
opponent I should be fighting.

00:14:19.340 --> 00:14:22.370
The members of the elite guard 
really are using aradama.

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:25.540
So this is the "human experimentation"
the letter mentioned.

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:29.690
Can a human really become so repulsive?

00:14:33.340 --> 00:14:35.800
Kanami, take the blonde with you.

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:37.140
What about you?

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:41.440
I'm going to stop her, with shorty here.

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:44.640
Got it! Let's go, Ellen-chan.

00:14:44.640 --> 00:14:47.110
Why did you come?

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:49.010
You could be in Irozaki by now...

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:54.150
Yeah, we thought about going,
 but we heard about her from Kaoru-chan...

00:14:54.150 --> 00:14:57.360
About how she was using aradama yesterday.

00:14:57.360 --> 00:14:58.280
So that's why?

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:01.790
Kaoru-chan was so worried about you.

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:03.850
Nene-chan told us.

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:06.040
Nene did?

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:12.530
<i>First my pet and now my partner...
I keep increasing my debt to you.</i>

00:15:17.340 --> 00:15:18.300
It's over.

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:19.930
Over?

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:22.330
Is it really, now?

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:36.830
What?

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:38.970
That's...

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:40.000
Yomi!

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.700
What is it? What happened?

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:46.000
Hiyori-chan, what's wrong?!

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:47.210
Kanami!

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:49.080
Hurry, and go! They're coming!

00:16:08.350 --> 00:16:09.690
Kaoru!

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:15.870
Hiyori-chan!

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:17.290
Don't move, Kanami!

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:19.930
She is beyond help...

00:16:25.870 --> 00:16:27.420
Over here!

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:30.790
I'll be your opponent now!

00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:40.870
Yomi...

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:43.050
She's taken on more noro 
than she can control.

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:45.220
We have to hurry.

00:16:45.220 --> 00:16:46.060
Right.

00:16:54.270 --> 00:16:55.190
Kanami!

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:04.910
Cut her down, Kanami!

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:06.530
She is no longer human!

00:17:06.530 --> 00:17:08.120
You're going to die!

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:13.290
Kanami!

00:17:22.630 --> 00:17:24.390
What's happening?

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:40.130
I'm saved?

00:17:40.130 --> 00:17:41.670
It seems so.

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:45.550
She probably couldn't balance 
the power of the noro.

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:50.080
Injecting the human body with 
noro is beyond reckless.

00:17:50.450 --> 00:17:52.990
It's because they use the aradama that way.

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:57.840
What a relief! She's still alive.

00:17:57.840 --> 00:17:59.540
What are we going to do now?

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:03.070
Other elite guards will come running 
because of this commotion.

00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:04.270
No problem.

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:05.570
Ellen...

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:07.800
Yes, roger that.

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:11.120
Please arrange a taxi for us urgently!

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:12.290
Taxi?

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:19.760
Stuff like this is a piece of cake
 for an organization like Mokusa.

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:22.530
There's no way we can escape 
on a boat like this.

00:18:22.850 --> 00:18:25.870
You there, contact the Japan Coast Guard.

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:27.970
There's no need to worry!

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:30.540
This isn't the taxi I summoned.

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:32.620
That is!

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:47.930
This was unpredictable.

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:51.250
Withdraw.

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:59.540
Inbound from the US military,
 no response on the patrol network

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:01.860
They have been unable to spot the target.

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:05.510
They completely managed to escape.

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:09.240
How could you fail with three 
members of the elite guard?

00:19:09.240 --> 00:19:11.810
Not to mention, one of you ended up like <i>that</i>.

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:19.150
How regrettable.

00:19:24.790 --> 00:19:25.880
Yukari-sama!

00:19:27.880 --> 00:19:29.620
My apologies.

00:19:29.620 --> 00:19:32.110
I have no excuses for this failure—

00:19:32.110 --> 00:19:34.050
Enough. Don't trouble yourself.

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:35.020
But...

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:38.370
The presidents from Minoseki Academy
 and the Heijou Institute

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:41.600
are dismissed from this special 
mission at the present time.

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:44.320
Return to your usual duties.

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:46.050
Yes, ma'am.

00:19:46.670 --> 00:19:47.450
Yes, ma'am.

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:49.030
Renpu President...

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:50.410
Yes!

00:19:50.720 --> 00:19:54.040
I believe I told you not to leave your post.

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:56.380
Yes, ma'am.

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:06.160
The two birds are right in 
the palm of my hand even now.

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:09.710
Why don't we guide them some more?

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:19.020
Now, Ema-chan, don't overdo it.

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:19.820
Huh?

00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:35.970
Sayaka, come with me.

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:48.850
Yukina...

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:55.510
Sayaka-chan.

00:20:56.640 --> 00:20:58.490
I'm glad you can leave.

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:02.770
We'll be going back to Minoseki tomorrow, too.

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:04.480
I see.

00:21:04.480 --> 00:21:05.420
Bye.

00:21:08.810 --> 00:21:11.310
Your cookies were delicious.

00:21:11.310 --> 00:21:12.500
Thank you.

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:14.120
I'll make some again if you'd like.

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:16.120
Okay.

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:18.620
Hey, do you have a cell phone?

00:21:18.980 --> 00:21:21.120
Let's exchange contact info.

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:25.170
Sayaka!

00:21:26.070 --> 00:21:27.070
Coming.

00:21:29.630 --> 00:21:32.000
Still the same as ever, Yukina.

00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:35.800
Sana?

00:21:36.570 --> 00:21:42.560
<i>Ah, thank goodness! Ema-senpai? I have 
just a teeny tiny favor to ask of you.</i>

00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:46.810
I don't have a single good memory 
attached to hearing you sound like that.

00:21:47.140 --> 00:21:52.450
<i>Don't say that! It's a request from S-a-n-a!</i>

00:21:54.650 --> 00:21:58.270
<i>I must have Yukari-sama's approval.</i>

00:21:58.950 --> 00:22:02.350
<i>It's Renpu and my reason for living...</i>

00:23:34.920 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Next Episode  Heart Ache</b>
